<p class="sub">2026/11/10（二）– 11/15（日）　每天 2–3 個點，慢慢逛</p>
<div class="facts">
<div><b>住宿位置</b>烏棟蘇一帶</div>
<div><b>回程</b>11/15 13:00 起飛</div>
<div><b>交通</b>市區搭 BTS，舊城區搭 Grab，11/13 包車</div>
<div><b>包車日</b>11/13 北攬府一日遊</div>
</div>
<div id="days"></div>
<section class="callout callout--note"><b>還沒排進去的地點</b><br>河對岸 Thonburi：<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=16356595055501497370" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AantArm Cafe</a>、<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=1209476392033675019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">水門寺</a>、<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=12921756033184211768" target="_blank" rel="noopener">藝術之家</a>、<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=2458010175474301461" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Indy Market Dao Khanong</a><br>北邊：<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=6775161292345137902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bang Sue Junction Shopping Center</a>、<a href="http://maps.google.com/?cid=2716792921386344829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Poncharoen Hua Pla</a><br><br><b>怎麼用</b><br>勾選框可記錄走過的地點，換一個可切換替代選項，每天的路線按鈕會依目前選擇開啟 Google 地圖，「回住處」會開啟住處的地圖頁，再按導航即可。</section>
<footer>營業時間和公休日請點地點名稱到 Google 地圖確認。車程為粗估，實際依路況。切換和勾選只存在你自己的裝置上。</footer>
<div id="live" class="sr" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
</main>
<script>
